        "text": "*%#$+"
      },
      {
        "key": "C",
        "text": "*%$#+"
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "*@#$+"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "*+$#+"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Look up each letter",
        "body": "From the table: R → \\*, A → %, N → #, G → \\$, O → +.\n\nSo RANGO is \\* % # \\$ +.\n\n**Answer: (B)**"
      },
      {
        "title": "Rule out quickly",
        "body": "A is %, so the second sign must be %: that leaves (B) and (C). N is # and comes before G (\\$), so it is (B).\n\n**Answer: (B)**"
      }
    ],
