        "body": "All five gates are around the cheese. Follow the corridors behind gates 1, 2 and 3 with your finger: they only lead to dead ends, so the mouse can never get to them. The mouse's corridors come down to gate 4 and to gate 5. Close these two and the cheese is safe.\n\n**Answer: (E) 4 and 5**"
