        "title": "Try the biggest squares",
        "body": "The biggest numbers are at the bottom right.\n\n- 14, 15, 19, 20: sum 68 > 63 ✓\n- 13, 14, 18, 19: sum 64 > 63 ✓\n- 12, 13, 17, 18: sum 60 — too small. All other squares are even smaller.\n\nSo Peter chose one of the two good squares. Both contain 14 (and 19).\n\n**Answer: (A) 14**"
