        "body": "At the end Tree 1 has 5 sparrows.\n\n- Before 4 sparrows came back, Tree 1 had $5 - 4 = 1$.\n- Before 7 sparrows flew away, Tree 1 had $1 + 7 = 8$.\n\n**Answer: (B) 8**"
